hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"277","[AI-translation] Hamay Mahmud bin Ghailan ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Sulaiman bin Harb ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Shu'bah ne haddes kiya, Al-A'mash se, Abi Wa'il se, 'Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, kehne lage: Maine ek raat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath namaz padhi, to aap khade rehte rahe yahan tak ke maine ek bure kaam ka irada kiya. Unse poocha gaya: Aapne kya irada kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Maine irada kiya ke baith jaun aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko chhod dun. Hamay Sufyan bin Waki' ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Jarir ne haddes kiya, Al-A'mash se, iske misl."
"278","[AI-translation] Hamay Ishaq bin Musa Al-Ansari ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Ma'n ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Malik ne haddes kiya, Abi Al-Nadr se, Abi Salamah se, Aisha (raziallahu anha) se: Ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baithe hue namaz padhte, to baithe hue qirat karte, phir jab unki qirat mein se itna baki rehta jitna tees ya chalees ayat ka hota, to khade ho jate aur khade hue qirat karte, phir ruku aur sajda karte, phir dusri rak'at mein bhi aisa hi karte."
"279","[AI-translation] Hamay Ahmad bin Mani' ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Hushaym ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Khalid Al-Hazza' ne haddes kiya, 'Abdullah bin Shaqiq se, kehne lage: Maine Aisha (raziallahu anha) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz aur unki nafl namaz ke bare mein poocha, to unhone kaha: Aap lambe arsay tak raat mein khade hue namaz padhte, aur lambe arsay tak baithe hue namaz padhte, to jab khade hue qirat karte to khade hi ruku aur sajda karte, aur jab baithe hue qirat karte to baithe hi ruku aur sajda karte."
"280","[AI-translation] Hamay Ishaq bin Musa Al-Ansari ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Ma'n ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Malik ne haddes kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Al-Sa'ib bin Yazid se, Al-Muttalib bin Abi Wada'ah se, Hafsah (raziallahu anha) se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zoja se, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni nafl namaz (subhat) mein baithe hue namaz padhte, aur surah padhte aur use tartil (ahesta ahesta) se padhte, yahan tak ke wo us se bhi lambi ho jaye jo us se lambi thi."
"281","[AI-translation] Hamay Hasan bin Muhammad Al-Za'farani ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Hajjaj bin Muhammad ne haddes kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, kahne lage: Mujhe Uthman bin Abi Sulaiman ne khabar di, ke Abu Salamah bin 'Abdur Rahman ne unhein khabar di, ke Aisha (raziallahu anha) ne unhein khabar di, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) wafat nahi paaye yahan tak ke unki aksariyat ki namaz baithe hue (padhi jane lagi) thi."
"282","[AI-translation] Hamay Ahmad bin Mani' ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Isma'il bin Ibrahim ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Ayyub ne haddes kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn 'Umar se, kehne lage: Maine Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Zohar se pehle do rak'atein, uske baad do rak'atein, aur Maghrib ke baad unke ghar mein do rak'atein, aur Isha ke baad unke ghar mein do rak'atein (namaz) padhi."
"283","[AI-translation] Hamay Ahmad bin Mani' ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Isma'il bin Ibrahim ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Ayyub ne haddes kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn 'Umar se, kehne lage: Hafsah ne mujhe haddes kiya: Ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) do rak'atein (namaz) padhte jab fajr tuloo hota aur mu'azzin azaan deta. Ayyub ne kaha: Aur mujhe lagta hai, unhone kaha: Halki do (rak'atein)."
"284","[AI-translation] Hamay Qutaibah bin Sa'id ne haddes kiya, kahne lage: Hamay Marwan bin Mu'awiyah Al-Fazari ne haddes kiya, Ja'far bin Burqan se, Maimun bin Mihran se, Ibn 'Umar se, kehne lage: Maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se aath rak'atein yaad ki hain: Zohar se pehle do rak'atein, uske baad do rak'atein, Maghrib ke baad do rak'atein, aur Isha ke baad do rak'atein. Ibn 'Umar ne kaha: Aur Hafsah ne mujhe Subah ki do rak'aton ka haddes kiya, halanki main Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se wo nahi dekhta tha."
